# Netlify (only used if the site is NOT hosted on Vercel).
# Every route has its own static file, and Netlify serves /404.html with a 404 status for unknown URLs,
# so no catch-all rewrite is needed (a catch-all would turn every bad URL into a soft-404).
https://vksflim.com/*  https://www.vksflim.com/:splat  301!
